 da: angular width (degrees), \n#      v: median velocity (km/s)\n#     dv: variation (1 sigma) of velocity over the width of the CME\n#   minv: lowest velocity detected within the CME\n#   maxv: highest velocity detected within the CME\n#  halo?: II if da>90, III if da>180, IV if da>270, indicating potential halo/partial halo CME\n# \n  </PRE>\n <td valign='top'>\n  <PRE>\n# CME |          t0    | dt0| pa | da |  v  |  dv | minv| maxv| halo?\n  <a href=\"CME0033/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0033</a>|2026/09/10 14:12| 04 | 238| 046| 0181| 0044| 0141| 0269|    \n  <a href=\"CME0032/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0032</a>|2026/09/10 11:12| 04 | 234| 026| 0135| 0126| 0100| 0397|    \n  <a href=\"CME0031/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0031</a>|2026/09/10 05:24| 00 | 261| 020| 0241| 0007| 0228| 0252|    \n  <a href=\"CME0030/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0030</a>|2026/09/10 05:12| 02 | 245| 036| 0168| 0023| 0129| 0213|    \n  <a href=\"CME0029/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0029</a>|2026/09/09 20:36| 01 | 076| 014| 0560| 0741| 0148| 1953|    \n  <a href=\"CME0028/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0028</a>|2026/09/09 18:00| 03 | 328| 026| 015"
